---
// In-article newsletter CTA
---

<aside class="inline-signup" aria-label="Newsletter subscription">
  <div class="inline-signup__content">
    <h3>Get coffee tips every Sunday</h3>
    <p>Join our free newsletter. Brews, gear notes, and shop tours — straight to your inbox.</p>
    <a
      href="/newsletter"
      class="btn btn--primary"
    >
      Subscribe free
    </a>
  </div>
</aside>

<style>
  .inline-signup {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #F5EFE6 0%, #EFE7D8 100%);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-accent-light);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: 2rem;
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .inline-signup h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .inline-signup p {
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    max-width: 480px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }
</style>
